      "content": "Title: Tunnels &amp; Trolls: Crusaders of Khazan. Crusaders of Khazan is a computer adaptation of the tabletop role-playing game \"Tunnels and Trolls\", developed and published by New World Computing in 1990 for the PC, FM Towns, PC-88 and PC-98. The game is available from Flying Buffalo and in Fiery Dragon's \"Tunnels and Trolls 30th Anniversary Edition\".",
